        <item>
    <title>What is rhythm?</title>
    <link>http://localhost/posts/rhythm/</link>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Aug 2025 15:11:00 &#43;0200</pubDate>
    <author>David Šimek</author>
    <guid>http://localhost/posts/rhythm/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2 id="meaning-of-rhythm">Meaning of rhythm?</h2>
<p><strong>Rhythm</strong> describes how you choose to <strong>space notes</strong> in section of music <strong>through time</strong>. There are some standard rhythms that have names, but there is infinite number of rhythms.</p>
<h2 id="where-can-i-find-it">Where can I find it?</h2>
<p>As rhythm is very broad term, it applies to all parts of songs including harmony, melody and drums.</p>
<h3 id="examples">Examples</h3>
<h3 id="rhythm-with-equal-distance-of-notes">Rhythm with equal distance of notes</h3>
<p><div class="details admonition info open">
        <div class="details-summary admonition-title">
            <i class="icon fas fa-info-circle fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>Did you know..<i class="details-icon fas fa-angle-right fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="details-content">
            <div class="admonition-content">This one is called <strong>even rhythm</strong></div>
        </div>
    </div>
<div class="rhythm-canvas-wrapper" style="width: 100%; height: 100px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
  
  
  <audio 
    id="rh1-audio" 
    src="/sound/rhythm4.mp3" 
    preload="auto"
    style="display:none;">
  </audio>

  
  <button class="rhythm-play-btn" id="rh1-play">▶ Play</button>

  
  <canvas 
    class="rhythm-canvas" 
    id="rh1-canvas"
    data-timestamps='0.4,1.4,2.4,3.4,4.4,5.4,6.4,7.4'
    style="width: 100%; height: 100%;">
  </canvas>
</div>


  <script src="/js/rhythmplayer.js"></script>
  


<style>
.rhythm-play-btn {
  background: #4CAF50;
  border: none;
  color: white;
  font-size: 18px;
  padding: 8px 16px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  cursor: pointer;
  margin-bottom: 5px;
  transition: background 0.2s;
}
.rhythm-play-btn:hover {
  background: #45a049;
}
</style>
</p>]]></description>
